CCVPE: Convolutional Cross-View Pose Estimation
-----------------------------------------------
Repository: https://github.com/tudelft-iv/CCVPE
Source: https://github.com/tudelft-iv/CCVPE/blob/main/models.py
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

The hierarchical matching and localization decoder in
unifygeo/models/localization_decoder.py adapts CCVPE's decoder. It changes the
feature widths, matching hierarchy, normalization, and reranking interfaces.
