GPL-3.0 text is provided in LICENSE.

SOLAR: Second-Order Loss and Attention for Image Retrieval
----------------------------------------------------------
Repository: https://github.com/tonyngjichun/SOLAR
Source: https://github.com/tonyngjichun/SOLAR/blob/master/solar_global/networks/networks.py
License: MIT

The second-order attention block in unifygeo/models/aggregators.py adapts
SOLAR's global SOABlock, with configurable normalization, an output-only
interface, and optional gradient checkpointing. The upstream MIT notice is
retained below.

